.staged-libs/

# Item definitions and models are build output: this tree commits generated/data and
# generated/.cache but never generated/assets, and a fresh checkout regenerates them
# with runDatagen before build. The rule is on `main` and in 26.3/.gitignore; without it
# here, a runDatagen in this tree leaves the upstream All-Rights-Reserved asset output
# sitting untracked, one `git add` away from the index.
src/main/generated/assets/
